      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ap.2.monbeg",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲩⲁϩⲉⲣⲁⲧⲟⲩ ϩⲛⲟⲩϩⲟⲧⲉ ⲙⲛⲟⲩ**ⲥⲧⲱⲧ** ⲉⲩϭⲱϣⲧ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ϩⲏⲧϥ ⲙⲡⲛⲉⲩⲙⲁ ⲙⲡⲁⲉⲓⲱⲧ :—",
      "english": "And they shall stand [there] in fear and trembling awaiting the Spirit of My Father.",
      "source": "Discourse on Abbaton, part 2",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:timothy.discourses.on_abbaton:22-54",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲗⲗⲁ ⲉⲛⲧⲁⲩϯⲥⲃⲱ ⲛⲁⲛ ϫⲉϩⲛⲟⲩϩⲟⲧⲉ ⲙⲛⲟⲩ**ⲥⲧⲱⲧ** ⲁⲣⲓϩⲱⲃ ⲉⲡⲉⲧⲛⲟⲩϫⲁⲓ .",
      "english": "But rather what was taught to us is to do something for our salvation in fear and trembling.",
